  "version": "1",
  "name": "Spot",
  "description": "A Uniswap v4 hook that implements dynamic LP fee management and protocol fee collection. In beforeSwap, it computes a dynamic fee (base + surge via DynamicFeeManager, or a manual override) and charges a protocol share on exactIn swaps; in afterSwap, it does the same for exactOut swaps. Collected fees are minted as ERC-6909 credits to a FullRangeLiquidityManager for optional auto-reinvestment, while a TruncatedGeometricOracle tracks tick movement for volatility-based fee tuning.",
